WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.233 --> 00:00:02.079
- Black Friday,

00:00:02.079 --> 00:00:04.413
the official kick off to
the holiday shopping season,

00:00:04.413 --> 00:00:06.735
and no other town does it
quite as good as this one.

00:00:06.735 --> 00:00:08.041
Now let's get out there

00:00:08.041 --> 00:00:11.244
and grab the best deal!

00:00:12.494 --> 00:00:13.688
- We really need a new TV.

00:00:13.688 --> 00:00:16.625
Look, they have the new
75-inch Tegu ultra-smart LED TV

00:00:16.625 --> 00:00:18.007
for 75% off.

00:00:18.007 --> 00:00:19.179
- Oh, yeah!

00:00:19.179 --> 00:00:20.409
If you're one of the first ten shoppers

00:00:20.409 --> 00:00:21.861
in the store on Black Friday,

00:00:21.861 --> 00:00:23.206
and that's never gonna happen.

00:00:23.206 --> 00:00:24.449
- Well why not?

00:00:24.449 --> 00:00:26.864
We have just as much of
a shot as anybody else.

00:00:26.864 --> 00:00:29.465
- I'm the number one shopper
in America three years running.

00:00:29.465 --> 00:00:30.962
I'm gonna buy all ten of those TVs,

00:00:30.962 --> 00:00:31.965
and I'm gonna sell them on ebay.

00:00:31.965 --> 00:00:32.987
- That's not fair!

00:00:32.987 --> 00:00:34.229
- Don't be a hero, Justin.

00:00:34.229 --> 00:00:36.166
Just give up.

00:00:36.166 --> 00:00:39.441
(maudlin piano music)

00:00:39.441 --> 00:00:40.996
- Ever since I was a little boy,

00:00:40.996 --> 00:00:42.281
I knew I was good at one thing.

00:00:43.318 --> 00:00:44.434
Getting things on sale.

00:00:44.434 --> 00:00:46.954
- Look, I know your dad
died trying to get a discman

00:00:46.954 --> 00:00:48.915
for 65% off in '94.

00:00:48.915 --> 00:00:50.088
- And was it worth it?

00:00:50.088 --> 00:00:50.854
Was it?

00:00:50.854 --> 00:00:52.874
- You are not your father!

00:00:52.874 --> 00:00:53.874
I think it's time for you

00:00:53.874 --> 00:00:56.152
to finally come out of the shadows!

00:00:56.152 --> 00:00:57.303
(sighing)

00:00:57.303 --> 00:00:58.916
- [Justin] This is what I have to do.

00:00:58.916 --> 00:01:00.113
- You're Oz Meredith.

00:01:00.113 --> 00:01:03.548
You got the BluRay player
for 97% off back in 2012.

00:01:03.548 --> 00:01:05.615
- That was a long time ago.

00:01:05.615 --> 00:01:07.391
I shop online now.

00:01:07.391 --> 00:01:08.413
- We need you.

00:01:08.413 --> 00:01:09.469
I need you.

00:01:10.576 --> 00:01:12.075
- We start tomorrow.

00:01:12.075 --> 00:01:15.365
(dramatic orchestrated pop)

00:01:15.365 --> 00:01:17.291
You need to be in tip-top shape!

00:01:17.291 --> 00:01:19.242
Come on, you turkeys!

00:01:19.242 --> 00:01:20.820
This ain't Cyber Monday!

00:01:20.820 --> 00:01:23.766
(aggressive, urban hip hop)

00:01:23.766 --> 00:01:25.785
This is the main show!

00:01:25.785 --> 00:01:29.104
You need to carry the box together!

00:01:30.724 --> 00:01:32.073
How bad can you want it?

00:01:32.073 --> 00:01:33.107
(heaving)

00:01:33.107 --> 00:01:35.173
Maybe you just ought to try Craig's List.

00:01:35.173 --> 00:01:36.672
Get me a light bulb.

00:01:36.672 --> 00:01:37.971
Now VHS.

00:01:37.971 --> 00:01:39.527
No! Again!

00:01:39.527 --> 00:01:40.885
Now you're cookin'!

00:01:40.885 --> 00:01:42.151
It's about finesse.

00:01:42.151 --> 00:01:45.089
You trample the mannequin,
you trample the shopper.

00:01:45.089 --> 00:01:47.526
And we don't trample people.

00:01:47.526 --> 00:01:49.272
You don't need to elbow.

00:01:49.272 --> 00:01:51.071
Focus. Breathe.

00:01:51.071 --> 00:01:53.147
(screaming)
And be great together!

00:01:53.147 --> 00:01:54.198
- Zack, where are you going?

00:01:54.198 --> 00:01:55.349
Mom wants to know if you're coming home

00:01:55.349 --> 00:01:56.881
for Thanksgiving dinner tomorrow.

00:01:56.881 --> 00:01:58.807
- I've got bigger plans.

00:01:58.807 --> 00:01:59.620
- What?

00:02:00.345 --> 00:02:01.344
(grunting)

00:02:01.344 --> 00:02:02.807
- Ryan, what happened to you?

00:02:02.807 --> 00:02:03.557
- Life.

00:02:04.431 --> 00:02:05.629
Life happened to me.

00:02:05.629 --> 00:02:08.090
You were never built for the
really big sales, Justin.

00:02:08.090 --> 00:02:09.948
All dreams and no fight.

00:02:09.948 --> 00:02:11.485
- I miss you, Justin.

00:02:11.485 --> 00:02:13.695
- [Ryan] This is Black Friday.

00:02:13.695 --> 00:02:15.216
- When you were born,
I promised your father

00:02:15.216 --> 00:02:17.352
that if anything ever happened to him...

00:02:17.352 --> 00:02:18.211
Do you get it?

00:02:18.211 --> 00:02:19.188
I'd take care of you.

00:02:19.188 --> 00:02:23.761
(mournful, spiritual music)

00:02:23.761 --> 00:02:24.981
- [Justin] Oz.
- [Other guy] Oz?

00:02:24.981 --> 00:02:26.180
- Oz, wake up, Oz.

00:02:26.180 --> 00:02:28.133
That's it. I'm done.

00:02:28.133 --> 00:02:29.736
- It's not over, Oz
would have wanted us...

00:02:29.736 --> 00:02:31.233
- Oz is dead!

00:02:31.233 --> 00:02:32.591
And I can't do this alone!

00:02:34.211 --> 00:02:35.453
- You're not alone.

00:02:35.453 --> 00:02:37.170
- Come. Join me.

00:02:37.170 --> 00:02:38.437
- I would rather play Call of Duty

00:02:38.437 --> 00:02:40.920
on a 32-inch standard
definition television

00:02:40.920 --> 00:02:42.477
with several broken pixels.

00:02:42.477 --> 00:02:47.301
(reverent music)

00:02:56.911 --> 00:02:59.732
- [Oz] You've had it
in you all along, kid.

00:02:59.732 --> 00:03:01.218
Your dad would be proud.

00:03:02.430 --> 00:03:04.855
This is about teamwork.

00:03:04.855 --> 00:03:07.481
This is about the man beside you.

00:03:07.481 --> 00:03:10.373
You will never be better than
when you are busting doors

00:03:10.373 --> 00:03:12.079
with your brother.

00:03:12.079 --> 00:03:13.261
Remember that.

00:03:14.795 --> 00:03:17.108
Find somebody you can trust.

00:03:17.108 --> 00:03:18.606
You can't put a price on that.

00:03:19.714 --> 00:03:21.067
Can't discount that.

00:03:22.709 --> 00:03:25.421
There's no coupon for friendship, son.

00:03:26.331 --> 00:03:27.869
That's not for sale.

00:03:30.510 --> 00:03:33.238
So get in there and pick what's yours.

00:03:33.238 --> 00:03:34.608
Greatness,

00:03:34.608 --> 00:03:35.892
friendship...

00:03:36.675 --> 00:03:39.600
And the 75-inch Tegu Ultra TV.

00:03:42.274 --> 00:03:43.472
♫ Witness what you got

00:03:43.472 --> 00:03:44.749
♫ And it's what it is

00:03:44.749 --> 00:03:45.955
♫ This is how we ride

00:03:45.955 --> 00:03:47.268
♫ This is how we live

00:03:47.268 --> 00:03:50.058
♫ Yeah, that's what it
takes to be the best, man

00:03:50.058 --> 00:03:51.777
- It's here! It's here.

00:03:51.777 --> 00:03:54.296
- [All] It's here!

00:03:54.296 --> 00:03:55.457
- It's here.

00:03:55.457 --> 00:03:56.154
- Get it.

00:03:56.154 --> 00:03:57.036
- Get it!
- Get it!

00:03:57.036 --> 00:03:58.650
- There.

00:03:58.650 --> 00:04:00.031
- I think they got it. Get it!

00:04:00.031 --> 00:04:01.436
- Yeah, you get it.

00:04:01.436 --> 00:04:02.940
- It's here.

